<main class="patchbay-shell patchbay-board pb-assistance pb-jev" id="patchbay-help-me">
  <.board_header title="Help Me">
    <:crumbs>PATCHBAY / JEV</:crumbs>
  </.board_header>
  <.assistance_nav current="help" />

  <div class="pb-jev-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="pb-assistance-eyebrow">Jev · Paid search</p>
      <h2>A way forward, when you're stuck.</h2>
      <p>Bring the question. Give Jev the context to look for an answer.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="pb-jev-preview">Preview</span>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-jev-workspace">
    <Regent.Structure.panel class="pb-jev-composer">
      <fieldset aria-describedby="jev-preview-note">
        <legend>What are you trying to do?</legend>
        <label class="pb-jev-label" for="jev-question">Your question</label>
        <textarea
          id="jev-question"
          name="question"
          rows="5"
          maxlength="4000"
          placeholder="I'm trying to connect my agent to a website, but its tools aren't appearing…"
        ></textarea>
        <label class="pb-jev-label" for="jev-site">Website <span>Optional</span></label>
        <input
          id="jev-site"
          name="site"
          type="url"
          placeholder="https://example.com"
          maxlength="2048"
        />
        <details class="pb-jev-context">
          <summary>Add an error or what you've tried</summary>
          <label class="pb-jev-label" for="jev-context">Extra context</label>
          <textarea
            id="jev-context"
            name="context"
            rows="3"
            maxlength="4000"
            placeholder="The tool name, exact error, and anything you've already tried."
          ></textarea>
        </details>
        <p class="pb-assistance-caption">
          Leave out passwords, API keys and private account details.
        </p>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="pb-jev-submit">
        <div>
          <strong>{RegentPayments.USDC.format(Patchbay.Assist.search_fee_atomic())} USDC per search</strong>
          <p id="jev-preview-note">
            Payment is not available in this preview. Nothing is charged; this draft stays on this page.
          </p>
        </div>
        <Regent.Primitives.button type="button" disabled aria-describedby="jev-preview-note">
          Search with Jev →
        </Regent.Primitives.button>
      </div>
    </Regent.Structure.panel>

    <aside class="pb-jev-guide" aria-labelledby="jev-guide-title">
      <p class="pb-assistance-eyebrow">A little context goes a long way</p>
      <h2 id="jev-guide-title">Start with the goal.</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <span>01</span><div>
            <strong>The outcome</strong><p>What should your agent be able to do?</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>02</span><div>
            <strong>The sticking point</strong><p>Which site or tool is getting in the way?</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>03</span><div>
            <strong>What happened</strong><p>
              An exact error is more useful than “it doesn't work.”
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="pb-assistance-caption">No search or payment starts in this preview.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="pb-jev-examples" aria-labelledby="jev-examples-title">
    <div class="pb-jev-examples-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="pb-assistance-eyebrow">20 decision trials · 5 candidates</p>
        <h2 id="jev-examples-title">See the next step Jev picked.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="pb-assistance-caption">
        Constructed problems using real tool definitions. Jev selected these suggestions; outcomes on the websites are not yet verified.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-jev-example-grid">
      <Regent.Structure.panel :for={example <- @examples} class="pb-jev-example">
        <p class="pb-assistance-eyebrow">{example["category"]} · {example["site"]}</p>
        <h3>{example["title"]}</h3>
        <p>{example["prompt"]}</p>
        <div class="pb-jev-example-answer">
          <span class="pb-assistance-eyebrow">Jev's selection</span>
          <p>{example["next_step"]}</p>
        </div>
        <details>
          <summary>Tools &amp; evidence</summary>
          <p><code>{Enum.join(example["tools"], ", ")}</code></p>
          <p class="pb-assistance-caption">
            Based on published tool captures. Real Jev decision call; no website tool execution. This is not a customer success story.
          </p>
        </details>
      </Regent.Structure.panel>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-jev-alternatives" aria-label="Other ways to get help">
    <span>Explore on your own</span>
    <a href="/?view=forum#pb-discussions">Search the forum ↗</a>
    <a href="/?view=sites">Browse sites ↗</a>
    <a href={~p"/test-me"}>Test Me ↗</a>
  </section>
</main>
